  "description": "Fighters of Record of Ragnarok for Teamfight Manager 2: Lu Bu, Thor, Zeus. Kits are our own designs after the manga's fights: Lu Bu's Shield Breaker counts his blows double against shields and shatters them for real (the pack's own code, ragnarok.dll); Thor's Mjolnir flies out and back to his hand and awakens on every third skill; Zeus swells into his muscle body once he warms up and presses it down into Adamas for his ultimate. Sharper frames from ragnarok.dll itself, with or without the League of Legends Heroes and Teamfight Tactics Heroes packs. Pixel art, effects, icons and sound effects made for this pack; Japanese voice lines from the official promotional recordings. Non-commercial fan project; Record of Ragnarok (c) its creators and publishers.",
